flowchart TD
    box_0(["Start"])
    box_1{"Is the marking controller powered on and in the<br/>ready state (no active fault or interlock)?"}
    box_2["Complete the following checks: 1. Read the marking<br/>controller status display and confirm the power<br/>indicator is lit. 2. Note any fault codes and cross-<br/>reference each against the fault code index. 3.<br/>Check the controller display for communication or<br/>interlock warnings."]
    box_3["Power cycle the marking controller following the<br/>shutdown and startup procedure. Wait for the full<br/>startup sequence to complete before reattempting<br/>communication."]
    box_4[/"Refer to the marking controller startup procedure."/]
    box_5{"Is the network or serial communication cable<br/>physically connected at both ends (marking<br/>controller and machine programmable controller)?"}
    box_6["Physically inspect the communication cable<br/>connectors at the marking controller port and at the<br/>machine programmable controller interface port.<br/>Check that both connectors are fully seated and the<br/>locking mechanism is engaged."]
    box_7["Reseat both connectors. If the cable is visibly<br/>damaged (kinked, crushed, or connector pins bent),<br/>replace the communication cable."]
    box_8{"Are there contaminated connector pins or ventilation<br/>slots on the marking controller or programmable<br/>controller interface card?"}
    box_9["Inspect the communication port connector pins on<br/>both devices for corrosion, dust build up, or bent<br/>pins. Check the controller ventilation slots for<br/>blockage."]
    box_10["Clean connector pins with a dry contact cleaner<br/>spray. Clear blocked ventilation slots with<br/>compressed air. Do not use abrasive tools on<br/>connector pins."]
    box_11{"Are there electrical defects in the network<br/>interface card, power supply, or ground connection?"}
    box_12["Complete the following checks: 1. Check the network<br/>interface card for fault indicator lights. 2. Check<br/>the marking controller internal power supply output<br/>voltage. 3. Verify that the controller fan and<br/>ventilation slots are unobstructed."]
    box_13["Replace the defective component identified (network<br/>interface card or power supply module). Ensure the<br/>earth ground connection is secure before power on."]
    box_14{"Are the communication protocol parameters (baud<br/>rate, IP address, or port number) correctly<br/>configured on both the marking controller and the<br/>machine programmable controller?"}
    box_15["Compare the communication parameter settings on the<br/>marking controller against the machine programmable<br/>controller configuration record. Check baud rate (or<br/>IP address and port for Ethernet), data bits, stop<br/>bits, and parity settings."]
    box_16["Correct any mismatched communication parameters on<br/>either device. Cycle the communication interface<br/>after making parameter changes."]
    box_17{"Has the communication link been restored and is the<br/>marking controller receiving and executing marking<br/>commands correctly?"}
    box_18["Send a test marking command from the machine<br/>programmable controller to the marking controller<br/>and verify that the marking controller acknowledges<br/>the command and executes the test mark."]
    box_19["Escalate to the maintenance team and marking<br/>controller supplier: the communication fault cannot<br/>be resolved through standard corrective actions."]
    box_20["Record all corrective actions, parameter settings,<br/>and the final communication test result in the<br/>maintenance log. Notify quality assurance team."]
    box_21(["Marking controller communication is restored. End."])
    box_22{"Is the marking controller completely unresponsive,<br/>preventing any part marking and requiring an<br/>immediate production line stop to preserve part<br/>traceability?"}
    box_23(["End, production line stopped immediately: marking<br/>controller unresponsive, no parts may proceed<br/>without marking, escalate to maintenance engineer<br/>and notify production supervisor"])

